# hair/adult/bun: Bun: the hair drawn back from a centre part into a low chignon at the nape; the ears clear
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair bun
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hairpose

